# Destiny 2 Shader Guessing Game
#
# Setup instructions:
# 1. Sign in to your Bungie.net account.
# 2. Visit https://www.bungie.net/en/Application
# 3. Register an application if you haven't already.
# 4. Copy the API key provided for your application.
# 5. Copy this file to .env.local.
# 6. Replace the placeholder below with your API key.
# 7. Run the project with: npm install && npm run dev
#
# IMPORTANT: Never commit your real .env.local file to GitHub.

VITE_BUNGIE_API_KEY=your_bungie_api_key_here
